// CoreSpanWriter is the write-only interface for the Cassandra span writer.
// It writes raw database model spans (dbmodel.Span) to Cassandra and serves as
// the foundation for the v2 tracestore.TraceWriter, which converts OTLP spans to
// dbmodel types and delegates to CoreSpanWriter.
